<title>CHINA: China 1996 cotton imports fall 12.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China 1996 cotton imports fall 12.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's cotton imports reached 650,000 tonnes in 1996, down by 12.2 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Imports in December alone were 60,000 tonnes. China imported 740,000 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>China's cotton exports in 1996 slumped 79.2 percent to 4,493 tonnes from 21,619 tonnes in the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports were zero tonnes in December alone.</p>
</text>
